/E (Customers who shop online often face difficulties when searching for clothing across multiple brands. They must visit different websites to compare products, prices, sizes, and styles. Furthermore, customers cannot easily visualize how a particular clothing item might look on them before purchasing it.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
